<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 240 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 240 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction May 20 versus May 13  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   207/214		358/365</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.13/3.15	    3.31/3.33</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.14/3.15	    3.31/3.34</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.12/3.15	    3.31/3.32</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   170/771		 70/1,905</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    472/1,961	    382/1,995</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 44,274 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
